# Mobile — Flutter Parent App (MVP)

## Structure

```
mobile/
  packages/
    core/           # Theme, constants, utils
    api_client/     # Dio client, interceptors, API models
    auth/           # Auth repository, token storage
  lib/
    features/
      auth/
      dashboard/
      attendance/
      fees/
      notifications/
      profile/
```

## State Management

- Riverpod 2.x — `@riverpod` code generation for providers
- `AsyncValue` for all API loading states

## Dio Interceptors

1. Auth token injection
2. Token refresh on 401
3. Error mapping to user-friendly messages

## Secure Storage

- `flutter_secure_storage` for access + refresh tokens
- Never log tokens

## MVP Screens

| Screen | API Dependencies |
|---|---|
| Login | `POST /api/v1/auth/login` |
| Child Selector | `GET /api/v1/students?guardianId=` |
| Dashboard | Attendance today + fee balance summary |
| Attendance | `GET /api/v1/attendance/student/{id}` |
| Fees | `GET /api/v1/fees/students/{id}/ledger` |
| Notifications | `GET /api/v1/notifications/inbox` |

## UI Rules

- Material 3 theming
- Pull-to-refresh on all list screens
- Offline: show cached data with stale indicator (Phase 2 full offline)
- Read-only MVP — no payment collection on mobile

## Do NOT

- Duplicate business logic from backend (validation, calculations)
- Hardcode tenant — resolve from login response/JWT
